      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Both are great on their own. But right now, they do not talk to each other.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Both are great on their own. But right now, they do not talk to each other.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "t-gap2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 66,
      "y": 408,
      "width": 918.0,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5b4a3a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 856216736,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 162458322,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So when Denials wins an appeal, that lesson stays inside that one claim. Nobody tells the next person.\nThe same mistake gets denied again - and it costs the same money, again.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So when Denials wins an appeal, that lesson stays inside that one claim. Nobody tells the next person.\nThe same mistake gets denied again - and it costs the same money, again.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 13
    },
